  "doubts": "Although named a circuit, the page says that for 2026/27 the Whakapapa Village to Mangatepopo Hut section is closed (2025 fire) and the track starts at Mangatepopo Carpark and ends in Whakapapa Village, so it is recorded as one way; the closed section is not recorded as a way. The circuit 'can be walked either direction' but no direction is named. The end, Whakapapa Village, is reached by one of two options (lower Taranaki Falls/Wairere stream section or upper tussock section of the Taranaki Falls loop); two road ends of the Taranaki Falls Track on Ngauruhoe Terrace (F2, F3) fit, so the village name T22 is given instead of guessing which. Mangatepopo Carpark is taken as F5, where the Tongariro Crossing meets Mangatepopo Road. The Waihohonu Stream is both crossed (a branch) and followed; it is listed once."
